# 2. THE PRODUCT

Product name: LEXQUEST AFRICA.

Tagline: Learn the Law. Master the Cases. Defend Your Reasoning.

Product vision:

Build a beautiful, interactive, mobile-first legal education game that turns freely accessible legal information, legislation, constitutional provisions, court judgments, legal textbooks, academic publications and educational materials into structured, engaging and progressively challenging learning experiences.

The initial target audience is Ghanaian law students.

The platform must subsequently accommodate students in other African countries whose legal systems have common-law foundations.

The game must work for:

- Someone who has just entered law school and knows almost nothing about law.
- A first-year LLB student.
- A second- or third-year law student.
- A final-year law student.
- A graduate preparing for professional legal education.
- An advanced student studying complex cases and legal theories.
- A law enthusiast who wants to understand how law operates in society.

The application must teach, test, challenge and reward students.

It must NOT become another boring multiple-choice quiz website.

It must feel like an adventure in which knowledge, critical thinking, judgment and legal reasoning unlock new achievements.

